# Build output is what the harness loads, but it is generated from `src/`.
# It is committed so the plugin works from a plain clone without a build step;
# the sources remain the reviewable form. Uncomment to build on install.
# lib/

# Preview artifacts: generated by scripts/preview.mjs and the CDP capture
# scripts. Useful locally, never part of the plugin. `docs/` is different: it
# holds the README screenshot and is published.
preview/

# Harness runtime state, if a probe profile is ever pointed here.
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
